### 4. Work text enlarged and card spacing adjusted

The user requested slightly larger text in the Work section shown in their screenshot. `src/components/work/Work.module.css` now uses larger responsive typography:

| Element | Current size rule |
| --- | --- |
| Eyebrow/project number | `clamp(.875rem, .9vw, .95rem)` |
| Main heading | `clamp(2.25rem, 3.4vw, 3.5rem)` |
| Intro paragraph | `clamp(1.35rem, 1.6vw, 1.6rem)` |
