## Update protocol for future AI sessions

Before editing, read the current requirement and pending work above; preserve completed changes unless the user revises them. After each meaningful change, update this file with the affected paths, resulting behavior, useful verification evidence, and any unresolved limitation. Keep in-progress and completed statuses distinct. Replace preliminary footer performance numbers with final measurements only after the actual content-deforming version has been tested. Keep the architecture documents synchronized if ownership, motion, or stage behavior changes.
